WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.040
We’ve all gotten lost in a&nbsp;
store before. It’s strange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.520
a little embarrassing, but&nbsp;
really nothing to worry about.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.880
Unless the store you’ve gotten lost in is&nbsp;
SCP-3008, also known as The Infinite Ikea.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.640
This cursed Ikea can be accessed through&nbsp;
a kind of portal in a particular but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.480
unknown Ikea superstore. You can&nbsp;
wander through it without even knowing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.400
and then become hopelessly lost in a&nbsp;
maze of affordable Swedish appliances.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.640
But it’s not just getting lost you have to worry&nbsp;
about. The infinite Ikea is filled with tall,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.720
faceless, humanoid entities dressed in Ikea&nbsp;
uniforms. These monsters, referred to as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.880
“The Staff”, begin hunting anyone still trapped&nbsp;
in the store when the lights go off at night.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.885
Thankfully, you’ll at least have company. The&nbsp;
Infinite Ikea is a kind of nexus between the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.885 --> 00:00:40.560
Ikeas in a number of different dimensions.&nbsp;
So many people have become trapped in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.320
Ikea over the years that whole tribes&nbsp;
and communities have formed inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:50.880
So you might as well make some friends and&nbsp;
enjoy some meatballs until you can escape!

